%% Title: Debrief and Skills Progression
%% Description: How session results turn into skill scores and XP

flowchart TD
    A[Session Ends] --> B[Full Transcript<br/>Sent to Synthesizer]
    B --> C[Groq llama-3.3-70b<br/>Analyzes Transcript]
    C --> D[Structured JSON Debrief]
    D --> E[4 Skill Scores<br/>1.0-5.0 Scale]
    D --> F[Key Insights]
    D --> G[Knowledge Gaps]
    D --> H[Strong Moments]

    E --> I[Running Average<br/>per Domain]
    I --> J[Update skill_scores<br/>in SQLite]

    E --> K[XP Calculation]
    K --> L[Base: 50]
    K --> M[Participation: +10/turn]
    K --> N[Quiz Bonus: +25/answered]
    K --> O[Score Bonus: avg * 20]
    L & M & N & O --> P[Total XP]

    P --> Q[Update engineer.total_xp]
    J --> R[SkillRadar SVG<br/>on Progress Page]
    P --> S[XP Bar Level Up]
